<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sale at Christchurch was 424 NZ cents per kg clean versus 415 at the sale on April 10, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - n/a vs n/a</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 565 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 360 vs 354</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 397 vs 395</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
